# Internal review and fix-plan working notes. The published specification lives in docs/
# (Protocol.md, Encryption.md, POST_QUANTUM_HARDENING_AND_MIGRATION.md); these are the
# point-in-time assessments and remediation plans behind it. They name findings against
# specific historical commits, so publishing them as-is would misrepresent the current
# state — CURRENT_SECURITY_HOLES.md, for one, reviews a commit whose findings are fixed.
# Publish a curated SECURITY.md and threat model instead.
